('0730354001', '0730354', 'OC Patti midi dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Red', 'Bright', 'Projects Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Projects', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Calf-length dress in airy, patterned chiffon with a V-neck opening with narrow ties at the top and frills. Long raglan sleeves with narrow elastication at the cuffs, an elasticated seam at the waist and a gently flared skirt. Partly lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0730356001', '0730356', 'OC Sabini dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Embroidery', 'Light Turquoise', 'Dusty Light', 'Projects Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Projects', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Short dress in chiffon with glittery metal thread embroidery and beaded appliqués. V-neck, sewn-in wrapover at the front, 3/4-length sleeves and an elasticated seam and detachable, twisted ties at the waist. Scalloped edges at the neckline, cuffs and hem. Partly lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0730359001', '0730359', 'OC Frenchie dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Lace', 'White', 'Light', 'Projects Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Projects', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Short dress in a cotton weave with broderie anglaise. Sweetheart neckline with narrow elastication at the back, covered buttons down the front and short sleeves with narrow, buttoned cuffs. Concealed zip in one side, a seam at the waist and flared skirt with a flounce at the hem. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
