('0733823001', '0733823', 'SC KOSTAS jumpsuit', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'All over pattern', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Jumpsuit in an airy, textured, zebra-striped crêpe weave made from a viscose blend with a deep V-neck, dropped shoulders and long sleeves with buttoned cuffs. Seam at the waist with sewn-on, gently draped panels that create a wrapover, pockets in the side seams, a low crotch and straight, wide legs. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733831001', '0733831', 'Viva Hood', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Colour blocking', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Tops Fancy Jersey', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Collection', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Short top in soft sweatshirt fabric with a stand-up collar, jersey-lined hood and a zip at the top. Low dropped shoulders and ribbing at the cuffs and hem. Soft brushed inside.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733831002', '0733831', 'Viva Hood', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Colour blocking', 'Light Grey', 'Dusty Light', 'Tops Fancy Jersey', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Collection', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Short top in soft sweatshirt fabric with a stand-up collar, jersey-lined hood and a zip at the top. Low dropped shoulders and ribbing at the cuffs and hem. Soft brushed inside.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733832001', '0733832', 'Cool Goldy necklace', 'Necklace', 'Accessories', 'Solid', 'Gold', 'Bright', 'Jewellery Extended', 'Ladies Accessories', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Small accessories', 'Accessories', 'Metal necklaces in different designs. One with one larger pendant and the other with two smaller pendants. Length from 42-49 cm.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733833002', '0733833', 'SC JONES skirt aop', 'Skirt', 'Garment Lower body', 'All over pattern', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Skirt woven in an airy, textured, zebra-striped cotton blend. Sewn-in wrapover with a tie detail and draping at the front. Fitted at the top with volume at the bottom and an asymmetric hem. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733834002', '0733834', 'SC POWER skirt', 'Skirt', 'Garment Lower body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Yellow', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Short, draped skirt in a zebra-striped weave with a concealed zip in one side and an asymmetric hem. Voluminous and draped at one side. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733835001', '0733835', 'COLAB NL Espadrille BG', 'Flat shoe', 'Shoes', 'All over pattern', 'Light Pink', 'Dusty Light', 'Young Girl Shoes', 'Children Accessories, Swimwear', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids & Baby Shoes', 'Shoes', 'NATHALIE LÉTÉ x H&M. Espadrilles in patterned cotton canvas with a sequined appliqué, elastic gores in the sides and a braided jute trim around the soles. Canvas linings and insoles and thermoplastic rubber (TPR) soles.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733836002', '0733836', 'SC MAGIC top', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Wide, sleeveless, straight-cut top in an airy rami weave. Double layer of large flounces at the top and a V-neck with a detailed trim and drawstring that can be pulled to tighten at the back of the neck and front. Narrow drawstring at the hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733837002', '0733837', 'Vera cardigan Lorry', 'Cardigan', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Light Grey', 'Dusty Light', 'Knitwear', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Knitwear', 'Oversized cardigan in soft, fine-knit wool with a tie belt at the waist, low dropped shoulders and long sleeves. Ribbing at the cuffs and hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733838002', '0733838', 'SC UTAH blouse', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'All over pattern', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Straight-cut blouse in an airy, zebra-striped rami weave. Yoke at the back with a small opening and button at the back of the neck, and puff sleeves that have volume at the top and taper to the cuffs where there is a button. Longer and gently rounded at the back, and slits in the sides.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733839003', '0733839', 'SC COLUMBUS blouse', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Blouse in pattern-weave viscose with a sheen. Stand-up collar, bib front with button placket, a gathered yoke at the back and long, wide sleeves with wide, buttoned cuffs. The blouse is in a straight cut with gently sloping side seams to create a gentle draping effect. Slits in the sides, longer at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733845001', '0733845', 'SC TEMPLE blouse', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'White', 'Light', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Wide, straight-cut blouse in an airy organic cotton weave with a wide, stand-up collar that creates a draped effect. Buttons at the back, gathers on the shoulders and a gathered yoke at the back. Extra-long, tapered sleeves with pin-tucks and wide, detachable cuffs. Pearly buttons. Rounded and longer at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733851001', '0733851', 'SC ZONE blouse', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Yellow', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Wide-fitting blouse in an airy, zebra-striped crêpe weave. High collar with a drawstring at the top and bottom, a deep V-neck with narrow ties, and oversized, raglan balloon sleeves with a drawstring at the cuffs. Contrasting colour panels with decorative seams down the sleeves. Longer at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733852001', '0733852', 'SC AMAZON dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Light Pink', 'Light', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Calf-length dress in airy, patterned chiffon crêpe. High collar with a drawstring at the top and bottom, a V-neck and decorative seams with piping at the front and back. Wide, raglan balloon sleeves with a drawstring at the cuffs and sewn-on panels with decorative seams. Asymmetric seam at the waist with a drawstring front and back. Asymmetric, wide skirt made from panels sewn together for a softly draping effect. Raw overlocked hem. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733854002', '0733854', 'SC DIVINE dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Yellow', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Dress in an airy, textured, zebra-striped crêpe weave made from a viscose blend. Seam at the front, a concealed zip at the back, dropped shoulders and long sleeves with buttoned cuffs. Seam at the waist with sewn-in, gently draping, wrapover panels, and a straight-cut skirt with a slit centre front and back. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733857001', '0733857', 'CAROL embr jkt', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Embroidery', 'Greenish Khaki', 'Medium Dusty', 'Young Girl Outdoor', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Cotton twill jacket with embroidery, a collar and buttons down the front. Fake chest pockets with a flap and button, and buttoned cuffs.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733858002', '0733858', 'SC HUDSON dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Shirt dress in linen and cotton twill with a stand-up collar and bib front with a button placket. Low dropped shoulders, wide sleeves with volume, and wide, buttoned cuffs. Gathers front and back for added volume, slightly twisted side seams and slits in the sides. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733864002', '0733864', 'SC BASEL dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Wide, calf-length dress in a viscose crêpe weave with a double layer of large flounces at the top and a V-neck with a detailed trim and a drawstring that can be pulled to tighten at the back of the neck and front. Extra-long sleeves with decorative pin-tucks and detachable cuffs. Asymmetric waist, heavily draping skirt and an asymmetric hem with a wide flounce. Raw-edge seams around the flounces at the neckline and hem. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733868003', '0733868', 'SC DIVINE jsy dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Yellow', 'Medium Dusty', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'STUDIO COLLECTION. Short dress in sturdy cotton jersey in a boxy fit with seam details at the top, dropped shoulders and short sleeves. Narrow, elasticated seam at the waist, sewn-on gently draped panels that create a wrapover, and a straight-cut skirt. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733869001', '0733869', 'Lauren VP2', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Front print', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Young Girl Jersey Fancy', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Young Girl', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Long-sleeved top in printed sweatshirt fabric with long sleeves and ribbing around the neckline, cuffs and hem. Soft brushed inside.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0733869002', '0733869', 'Lauren VP2', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Front print', 'White', 'Light', 'Young Girl Jersey Fancy', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Young Girl', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Long-sleeved top in printed sweatshirt fabric with long sleeves and ribbing around the neckline, cuffs and hem. Soft brushed inside.', NULL, 0, 0),
