('0737543001', '0737543', 'Lumiere padded abeline', 'Bra', 'Underwear', 'Contrast', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Expressive Lingerie', 'Lingeries/Tights', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Lingerie', 'Under-, Nightwear', 'Soft, non-wired bra in lace with padded cups that shape the bust and provide good support. Adjustable shoulder straps, a wide lace trim at the hem and a hook-and-eye fastening at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
