('0738761002', '0738761', 'PE HELIOS PRINT KAFTAN', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Orange', 'Dark', 'Take Care External', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Collaborations', 'Unknown', 'Kaftan in an airy, printed Tencel™ lyocell and silk weave with a V-neck and slits at the front of the hem. Shorter at the front and longer at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0738767002', '0738767', 'PE CADIZ MINI DRESS', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Take Care External', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Collaborations', 'Unknown', 'Short dress in an airy rami weave with a deep V-neck and an opening at the front that fastens with narrow ties at the top. Deep opening at the back, dropped shoulders and balloon sleeves with buttons at the cuffs. Gathered seam at the waist, a concealed zip in one side and a fitted skirt with narrow elastication and gathers at the front. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0738768001', '0738768', 'PE CREMA PRINTED DRESS 3', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Take Care External', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Collaborations', 'Unknown', 'Short, wide dress in an airy, patterned pima cotton weave with a small stand-up collar with narrow ties and an opening at the top. Low dropped shoulders, long, wide sleeves and wide cuffs with decorative stitching and adjustable buttoning. Gathers at the top to create soft draping. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
