('0746292001', '0746292', 'Erik linen slim blz', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Melange', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Blazer', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Single-breasted jacket in a linen weave with narrow notch lapels with a decorative buttonhole. Chest pocket with a contrasting colour lining that can be used as a handkerchief, flap front pockets and three inner pockets, one with a button. Two buttons at the front, decorative buttons at the cuffs and a single back vent. Lined. Slim Fit that tapers at the chest and waist, which combined with slightly narrower sleeves creates a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0746292002', '0746292', 'Erik linen slim blz', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Melange', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Blazer', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Single-breasted jacket in a linen weave with narrow notch lapels with a decorative buttonhole. Chest pocket with a contrasting colour lining that can be used as a handkerchief, flap front pockets and three inner pockets, one with a button. Two buttons at the front, decorative buttons at the cuffs and a single back vent. Lined. Slim Fit that tapers at the chest and waist, which combined with slightly narrower sleeves creates a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0746292003', '0746292', 'Erik linen slim blz', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Melange', 'Dark Red', 'Dark', 'Blazer', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Single-breasted jacket in a linen weave with narrow notch lapels with a decorative buttonhole. Chest pocket with a contrasting colour lining that can be used as a handkerchief, flap front pockets and three inner pockets, one with a button. Two buttons at the front, decorative buttons at the cuffs and a single back vent. Lined. Slim Fit that tapers at the chest and waist, which combined with slightly narrower sleeves creates a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0746292004', '0746292', 'Erik linen slim blz', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Melange', 'Blue', 'Light', 'Blazer', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Single-breasted jacket in a linen weave with narrow notch lapels with a decorative buttonhole. Chest pocket with a contrasting colour lining that can be used as a handkerchief, flap front pockets and three inner pockets, one with a button. Two buttons at the front, decorative buttons at the cuffs and a single back vent. Lined. Slim Fit that tapers at the chest and waist, which combined with slightly narrower sleeves creates a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0746295001', '0746295', 'Erik linen slim trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Melange', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Trouser', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Suit trousers in a linen weave with an extended waistband with concealed hook-and-eye fasteners and a zip fly. Side pockets, welt back pockets with a button, and legs with creases. Slim Fit that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to created a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
