('0746297001', '0746297', 'Lund rain trouser', 'Outdoor trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Light Pink', 'Dusty Light', 'Baby Boy Outdoor', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Boy', 'Outdoor', 'Rain trousers in wind- and waterproof functional fabric with closed seams and reflective details. Elastication at the back of the waist, press-studs at the sides, elasticated hems and a reinforced elastic strap under the feet. Adjustable elastic braces with plastic fasteners. Unlined. The trousers have a water-repellent coating without fluorocarbons.', NULL, 0, 0),
