('0750041001', '0750041', 'ROXY romper', 'Jumpsuit/Playsuit', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Light Pink', 'Dusty Light', 'Newborn', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Short, sleeveless romper suit in soft ribbed jersey made from an organic cotton blend with an open chest pocket, buttons on the shoulders and sewn-in turn-ups at the hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
