('0750673001', '0750673', 'BD SS Simon seersucker', 'Shirt', 'Garment Upper body', 'Stripe', 'Light Blue', 'Light', 'Shirt', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Shirts', 'Short-sleeved shirt in striped cotton seersucker with a concealed button-down collar and classic front. Yoke at the back, an open chest pocket and a rounded hem. Regular Fit – a classic fit with good room for movement and a gently shaped waist to create a comfortable, tailored silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
