('0751935001', '0751935', 'Nella Off-shoulder dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'White', 'Light', 'Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Calf-length dress in a cotton weave with a sewn-in wrapover at the top, narrow, adjustable shoulder straps and a V-neck with a wide, elasticated flounced trim. Seam below the bust and a seam and wide flounce at the hem. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
