('0753572001', '0753572', 'GLOVE SOFTSHELL FUNCTION', 'Gloves', 'Accessories', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Young Boy Big Acc', 'Children Accessories, Swimwear', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Accessories', 'Water-repellent, softshell gloves with a soft fleece lining and reinforced palms in imitation leather. Elastication at the wrists, reflective details and a plastic hook-and-eye fastening to keep the gloves together. The tops of the thumb and index finger are made from touchscreen-compatible material.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0753572002', '0753572', 'GLOVE SOFTSHELL FUNCTION', 'Gloves', 'Accessories', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Young Boy Big Acc', 'Children Accessories, Swimwear', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Accessories', 'Water-repellent, softshell gloves with a soft fleece lining and reinforced palms in imitation leather. Elastication at the wrists, reflective details and a plastic hook-and-eye fastening to keep the gloves together. The tops of the thumb and index finger are made from touchscreen-compatible material.', NULL, 0, 0),
